#### [MODIFY] [JwtService.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/service/JwtService.java)
- Utility service for building, signing, parsing, and validating JWT tokens using HMAC-SHA256 and JJWT library. Exposes helper methods: `generateToken(email, claims)`, `extractEmail(token)`, `validateToken(token, userDetails)`.

#### [MODIFY] [AuthService.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/service/AuthService.java) & [AuthServiceImpl.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/service/impl/AuthServiceImpl.java)
- Interface and implementation defining authentication business logic:
  - `register(RegisterRequest)`: validates password match, checks email uniqueness, encodes password with BCrypt, attaches `ROLE_USER`, saves user to DB, returns user metadata.
  - `login(LoginRequest)`: authenticates user via Spring Security `AuthenticationManager`, generates JWT access token and database-stored refresh token, returns `JwtResponse`.
  - `refreshToken(RefreshTokenRequest)`: validates refresh token presence and expiration in DB, issues new JWT access token and updated refresh token.
  - `logout(String userEmail / String token)`: revokes and deletes refresh token from DB.
  - `getProfile(String email)`: fetches current user details and returns `UserProfileResponse`.

#### [MODIFY] [UserDetailsServiceImpl.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/security/UserDetailsServiceImpl.java)
- Spring Security `UserDetailsService` implementation: loads `User` entity by email, converts user roles into `GrantedAuthority` objects, returns standard `org.springframework.security.core.userdetails.User`.

#### [MODIFY] [JwtAuthenticationFilter.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/security/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java)
- Extends `OncePerRequestFilter`. Intercepts incoming HTTP requests, parses `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, validates JWT token, and sets security context (`SecurityContextHolder`).

#### [MODIFY] [SecurityConfig.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/security/SecurityConfig.java)
- Configures Spring Security 6 / Spring Boot 3+ `SecurityFilterChain`:
  - Disables CSRF (stateless API).
  - Configures stateless session creation policy (`SessionCreationPolicy.STATELESS`).
  - Permits public endpoints: `POST /api/auth/register`, `POST /api/auth/login`, `POST /api/auth/refresh`.
  - Protects remaining endpoints: `POST /api/auth/logout`, `GET /api/auth/me`.
  - Registers `JwtAuthenticationFilter` before `UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken.class`.
  - Exposes `AuthenticationManager` and `PasswordEncoder` (`BCryptPasswordEncoder`) beans.

#### [NEW] [DataInitializer.java](file:///d:/projects/G-Drive-Clone/Backend/AUTH-SERVICE/src/main/java/com/clone/drive/config/DataInitializer.java)
